    <region left="0" top="0" width="751" height="38" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="font-weight: bold;">2. Simulate the following circuit for 1ms, and compare the output voltage and current through each resistor with the results in Lab 1.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="36" width="240" height="157" color="#000000">
      <picture>
        <raw format="png" encoding="base64"></raw>
      </picture>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="198" width="144" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
